\cf12 01\
\cf2 WHY THIS WORK\

\fs56 \cf0 The gap is already being paid for.\

\fs32 \cf5 The difference between a well resourced school and a stretched one is rarely commitment. It is time and money. Schools that can afford specialist capacity on staff buy it. Schools that cannot absorb the same work through teachers\'92 unpaid hours and stretched expertise.\
We start from the position that your staff are already doing their best. The job is not to tell a school it is failing. It is to improve the tools and processes available, at a fraction of the time and cost it would take to build the same capability alone.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa400\partightenfactor0

